  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - West Bank - Water, Sanitation and Hygiene</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA will restore access to WASH services in highly affected camps in the North and other vulnerable areas by repairing water and sewage networks and making emergency household connections. The Agency will address solid waste collection needs by hiring additional sanitation labourers, maintaining its waste management fleet, and replacing damaged containers. To mitigate winter flooding, drains and storm water channels will be cleared. UNRWA will also repair and rehabilitate WASH facilities in select schools and health centres to sustain critical services.</narrative>
  </description>
